{"entryType": "UniProtKB reviewed (Swiss-Prot)", "primaryAccession": "P25063", "secondaryAccessions": ["A0A087WYI6", "B6EC88", "Q16257", "Q53XS0", "R4I4T5"], "uniProtkbId": "CD24_HUMAN", "entryAudit": {"firstPublicDate": "1992-05-01", "lastAnnotationUpdateDate": "2026-06-10", "lastSequenceUpdateDate": "2018-03-28", "entryVersion": 194, "sequenceVersion": 3}, "annotationScore": 5.0, "organism": {"scientificName": "Homo sapiens", "commonName": "Human", "taxonId": 9606, "lineage": ["Eukaryota", "Metazoa", "Chordata", "Craniata", "Vertebrata", "Euteleostomi", "Mammalia", "Eutheria", "Euarchontoglires", "Primates", "Haplorrhini", "Catarrhini", "Hominidae", "Homo"]}, "proteinExistence": "1: Evidence at protein level", "proteinDescription": {"recommendedName": {"fullName": {"value": "Signal transducer CD24"}}, "alternativeNames": [{"fullName": {"value": "Small cell lung carcinoma cluster 4 antigen"}}], "cdAntigenNames": [{"value": "CD24"}], "flag": "Precursor"}, "genes": [{"geneName": {"value": "CD24"}, "synonyms": [{"value": "CD24A"}]}], "comments": [{"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250", "source": "UniProtKB", "id": "P24807"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "11313396"}], "value": "May have a pivotal role in cell differentiation of different cell types. Signaling could be triggered by the binding of a lectin-like ligand to the CD24 carbohydrates, and transduced by the release of second messengers derived from the GPI-anchor. Modulates B-cell activation responses. Promotes AG-dependent proliferation of B-cells, and prevents their terminal differentiation into antibody-forming cells (PubMed:11313396). In association with SIGLEC10 may be involved in the selective suppression of the immune response to danger-associated molecular patterns (DAMPs) such as HMGB1, HSP70 and HSP90. Plays a role in the control of autoimmunity (By similarity)"}], "commentType": "FUNCTION"}, {"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "11313396"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "8753773"}], "value": "Interacts with LYN and FGR in a cell-type specific manner. Binds FRG in a small cell cancer line, LYN in the erythroleukemia cell line K-562 and in Burkitt's lymphoma"}], "commentType": "SUBUNIT"}, {"commentType": "INTERACTION", "interactions": [{"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "P25063", "intActId": "EBI-6267018"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "P07948", "geneName": "LYN", "intActId": "EBI-79452"}, "numberOfExperiments": 6, "organismDiffer": false}]}, {"commentType": "SUBCELLULAR LOCATION", "subcellularLocations": [{"location": {"value": "Cell membrane", "id": "SL-0039"}, "topology": {"value": "Lipid-anchor, GPI-anchor", "id": "SL-9902"}}]}, {"commentType": "ALTERNATIVE PRODUCTS", "events": ["Alternative splicing"], "isoforms": [{"name": {"value": "1"}, "isoformIds": ["P25063-1"], "isoformSequenceStatus": "Displayed"}, {"name": {"value": "2"}, "isoformIds": ["P25063-2"], "sequenceIds": ["VSP_059359"], "isoformSequenceStatus": "Described"}]}, {"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "14657362"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "8753773"}], "value": "B-cells. Expressed in a number of B-cell lines including P32/ISH and Namalwa. Expressed in erythroleukemia cell and small cell lung carcinoma cell lines. Also expressed on the surface of T-cells"}], "commentType": "TISSUE SPECIFICITY"}, {"texts": [{"value": "Expression is lost when primary B-cells are induced to differentiate in antibody-forming cells"}], "commentType": "INDUCTION"}, {"texts": [{"value": "Extensively O-glycosylated"}], "commentType": "PTM"}, {"commentType": "DISEASE", "disease": {"diseaseId": "Multiple sclerosis", "diseaseAccession": "DI-02604", "acronym": "MS", "description": "A multifactorial, inflammatory, demyelinating disease of the central nervous system. Sclerotic lesions are characterized by periva